  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bahia Street will offer 120 girls and young women between the ages of 6 and 17 classes to supplement their school curriculum, instruction in health and nutrition, and career counseling and mentoring toward a successful transition to high school and university. Other aspects of its program are expected to reach another 170 Brazilians, including the students&apos; parents, caregivers and teachers as well as additional students in public schools in Salvador da Bahia.</narrative>
